  "summary": "Set Ctrl Source to Network at the unit, then write NetworkCtrl for on/off/ventilation/economy and SuWiNetworkChgover for cool/heat, plus the comfort setpoints. Read UnitStatusMS, the controlled and supply temperatures and the global alarm output.",
  "minimum_points": [
   {
    "ref": "MV 24562",
